Subject: [PATCH] testscript: drain the pty before closing its controller

Closing the controller while the reader goroutine still had output
queued dropped it, so a loaded machine lost a prompt and ttyout failed.
Once the command exits and the tty closes, the read ends at EIO with
every byte copied.
---
--- a/testscript/testscript.go
+++ b/testscript/testscript.go
@@ -1053,8 +1053,8 @@
 		}()
 		defer func() {
 			tty.Close()
-			ctrl.Close()
 			<-doneR
+			ctrl.Close()
 			<-doneW
 			ts.ttyin = ""
 			ts.ttyout = ptyBuf.String()
